{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53192","headline":"诗偈 十七 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十方同一等，此是真如寺。\n里有无量寿，本来无名字。\n凡夫不入理，心缘世上事。\n乞钱买瓦木，盖他虚空地。\n却被六贼驱，背却真如智。\n终日受艰辛，妄想图名利。\n如此学道人，累劫终不至。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}